# MODULE native guest CPU diagnostic executable wrapper
# PURPOSE execute unchanged Android guest instructions under Linux AArch64 CPU emulator
# INPUT unsigned two byte guest length then exact guest bytes
# OUTPUT Linux ELF diagnostic not Android production library
# TAPE zero and one remaining guest count two byte three through six loop scratch
# TAPE eight byte printer nine through eleven literal zero run scratch
# TAPE twelve and thirteen remaining padding fourteen through sixteen borrow scratch
# REQUIREMENT guest at most twelve thousand two hundred eighty eight bytes
# REQUIREMENT independently admitted guest and exact input length close
# RUNTIME stdin context forty result fifty six sink return eight bytes
# RUNTIME stdout attempted tag and message then result fifty six native return four
# LIMITATION one regular file read and fixed diagnostic layout not production adapter

